{{wikipedia|sharpshooter (insect)}}

===Etymology===
{{m|en|sharp}} + {{m|en|shooter}}, a {{cal|en|de|Scharfschütze|nocap=1}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A person trained to shoot [[precisely]] with a [[rifle]]; a [[marksman]].
#: {{cot|en|rifleman|sniper}}
# A [[proconiine]] (type of [[leafhopper]]).
# {{lb|en|professional wrestling|}} A submission hold characterized by one wrestler twisting the other's legs upwards while sitting on their back.

